<title>USA: Bellingham, Mass., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Bellingham, Mass., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc., said it won $3.953 million of Bellingham, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1996 bonds, with a netinterest cost of 4.75 percent.</p>
</text>
